Step 1 – Create Project Folder
mkdir Week5-Ethical-Hacking
cd Week5-Ethical-Hacking

Step 2 – Add README
nano README.md


Paste the 15-line README above → Save → CTRL+X → Y → Enter

Step 3 – Add Reports & Scripts

Add Nikto report: nikto_report.txt

Add ZAP HTML report: zap_report.html

Add Lynis log: /var/log/lynis.log

Add screenshots, scripts, payloads, any notes

Step 4 – Initialize Git
git init

Step 5 – Stage All Files
git add .

Step 6 – Commit Changes
git commit -m "Week 5 Ethical Hacking and Vulnerability Exploitation"

Step 7 – Create GitHub Repository

Go to GitHub → New Repository

Name: Week5-Ethical-Hacking

Do not initialize with README → Click Create

Step 8 – Push Local Repo to GitHub
git remote add origin https://github.com/yourusername/Week5-Ethical-Hacking.git
git branch -M main
git push -u origin main
